Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Flash Off : Curs Off : Cls 0
Palette $000,$FFF,$F00,$0F0,$00F,$FF0,$0FF,$F0F,$888,$F80,$08F,$8F0,$F08,$80F,$0F8,$444
E$=Chr$(27)
Print "Line one";Chr$(13);"CR";Chr$(10);"down"
Print "abcdefgh";Chr$(8);Chr$(8);"XY";Chr$(29);Chr$(29);"Z"
Print "T1";Chr$(9);"T2";Chr$(9);"T3"
Print E$;"B2";E$;"P5";"colours";E$;"B0";E$;"P1"
Print E$;"I1";"inverse";E$;"I0";" ";E$;"U1";"under";E$;"U0";" ";E$;"S1";"shade";E$;"S0"
Print E$;"W1";"or";E$;"W2";"xor";E$;"W3";"and";E$;"W0";"norm"
Print "0123456789";E$;"X3";"x3";E$;"Y12";"y12"
Print E$;"M0";"memo";E$;"M1";"R";E$;"M2";Chr$(10);E$;"M3";"Q"
Print "AAAAAAAA";Chr$(8);Chr$(8);Chr$(8);Chr$(8);E$;"Q3"
Print "rel";E$;"N";Chr$(48+128+3);"+3";E$;"O";Chr$(48+128-1);"up"
Print "rep:";E$;"R0";"ab";E$;"R3";"|"
Print "frame";E$;"E0";Chr$(10);Chr$(10);"     ";E$;"E1"
Locate 0,16 : Print "eraseEOL";Chr$(29);Chr$(29);Chr$(29);Chr$(7)
Locate 0,17 : Print "line to clear";Chr$(26);"after"
Locate 0,18 : Print "planes";E$;"J1";"J1";E$;"J7";"J7";E$;"J15"
Locate 0,19 : Print "cur";E$;"D7";E$;"C1";E$;"C0"
Locate 0,20 : Print "Tab5";E$;"T5";Chr$(9);"x";Chr$(9);"y";E$;"T4"
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/text1_1.iff"
Cls 0 : Locate 0,0
For I=0 To 30 : Print "Scroll line";I : Next I
Locate 0,5 : Print Chr$(16);Chr$(16);"<";Chr$(18);">";
Locate 0,6 : Print Chr$(17);
Locate 0,8 : Print Chr$(20);
Locate 0,10 : Print Chr$(21);
Locate 0,12 : Print Chr$(22);
Locate 0,14 : Print Chr$(23);
Locate 0,20 : Print Chr$(19);
Locate 30,22 : Print Chr$(30);Chr$(31);Chr$(28);"*";
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/text1_2.iff"
Cls 0 : Home
Wind Open 1,0,0,18,8,1 : Title Top "One" : Print "Border 1"
Wind Open 2,160,0,18,8,2 : Title Top "Two" : Title Bottom "bot" : Print "Border 2"
Wind Open 3,0,80,18,8,3 : Print "Border 3"
Wind Open 4,160,80,18,8,4 : Print "Border 4"
Wind Open 5,80,40,18,8,5 : Print "Border 5, on top";Chr$(13);Chr$(10);"of the others"
Wind Open 6,80,150,18,5,15 : Print "Border 15"
Border 5,3,4
Wind Open 7,200,160,10,3 : Print "gr";E$;"K1";Chr$(1);Chr$(2);Chr$(13);Chr$(27);"K0"
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/text1_3.iff"
Window 1 : Print "back to one" : Window 3 : Print "three"
Wind Move 100,100 : Window 2 : Wind Size 12,5 : Print "small"
Window 5 : Wind Close : Window 6 : Wind Close
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/text1_4.iff"
Screen Open 1,640,200,4,Hires : Flash Off : Curs Off : Cls 0
For I=0 To 25 : Print "Hires text, line";I;" with some more words to wrap around the edge" : Next I
Inverse On : Print "inv"; : Inverse Off : Shade On : Print "sha"; : Shade Off : Under On : Print "und" : Under Off
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/text1_5.iff"
Screen Open 2,320,200,2,Lowres : Flash Off : Curs Off : Cls 0
Print "One plane";E$;"I1";"inv";E$;"I0" : Paper 0 : Pen 1 : Print "pen 1"
Double Buffer : Autoback 1
Print "Autoback printing" : Locate 5,5 : Print "here" : Centre "middle"
Screen Swap : Wait Vbl
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/text1_6.iff"
Curs On : Print "cursor on"; : Locate 3,12 : Print "at 3,12"; : Centre "c"
Screen Swap : Wait Vbl
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/text1_7.iff"
Print #1,X Curs;Y Curs
Print #1,"end"
